docs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r76d.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r76e.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r76f.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r76g.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r76h.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r77.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r77b.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r78.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/release_check.py\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/release_screen.mjs\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/release_screen_prepare.py\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round76-brief.md\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round77-brief.md\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round77b-brief.md\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/round78-brief.md\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74b.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74e.md\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74d.md\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74h.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/release_check.py\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74d.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74.md\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/release_screen.mjs\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74j.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74j.md\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74f.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/release_screen_prepare.py\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74c.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74i.md\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74h.md\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74e.stream\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74g.md\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/codex-r74c.md\ndocs/research/202