screen (36–374 px) |\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/RELEASE-PAGE-RESULT.md:78:- **What.** The first screenshot showed a dangling comma when a source has no original day (\"original: NVIDIA,\"). The page now adds\ndocs/research/2026-11-22-number-answers/RELEASE-PAGE-RESULT.md:81:  (`release-screen-2026-11-23b`), the screen check re-run (zero failures, all eight negatives caught), and the new template hash\npoc/data/release-check-2026-11-23g/old-1/package/release-data.json\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
